  "notes": "Simple defeat in place: X eyes, slack tongue-out mouth, stretched flop with staggered legs; the small far hind leg is hidden behind the tail from frame 10 onward, followed by a small settling bounce. Starts on the exact base frame and ends in a held defeated pose. Read left to right, top to bottom. Existing head, mane, tail and body artwork reused; no frame crossfades. 24 frames at 30ms. Shorter-rear-leg revision brings the visible back paw inward and up to approximately match the annotated front paw, while retaining its slant. Belly-outline revision strengthens the abdomen contour from approximately six to ten pixels, matching the bold main outlines more closely. Extra ink grows inward, retaining the belly curve, slanted rear-leg pose, and timing. Earlier muzzle, hip marking and tail cleanup is retained."
